menu "ToDoHelper: word service"

    config TODOHELPER_WORD_DAILY_COUNT
        int "Default number of words per day"
        range 1 100
        default 10
        help
            Overridable at runtime through the NVS key `word_daily`.

    config TODOHELPER_WORD_EXPORT_TEMPLATE
        bool "Write the starter wordbook to storage when none is present"
        default y
        help
            Copies the compiled-in sample book to
            <storage>/todohelper/words/<book>.json so it can be edited or
            replaced with a real CET4/CET6 list without reflashing.

endmenu
